    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paperlands</i> is a relaxing 2D puzzle adventure set in a papercraft world where everything can be interacted with only if brought to life with color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with no colors and gradually unlock new colors as you complete puzzles and help the people of Paperlands with their requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring things with different colors is the key and it can have interesting effects which will help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color the objects and people to be able to interact with them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/50f99af1df81ad4e51d71bec106b4256.poster.avif?t=1752093461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/50f99af1df81ad4e51d71bec106b4256.webm?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/50f99af1df81ad4e51d71bec106b4256.mp4?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and traditional puzzles by using the colors, unlock new colors and reach new locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/5ab354ca1ff8683733b92abcf13c9529.poster.avif?t=1752093461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/5ab354ca1ff8683733b92abcf13c9529.webm?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/5ab354ca1ff8683733b92abcf13c9529.mp4?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative and color the world to your liking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/f257aa53aee5687a879ab13ea64fed94.poster.avif?t=1752093461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/f257aa53aee5687a879ab13ea64fed94.webm?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/f257aa53aee5687a879ab13ea64fed94.mp4?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the people of Paperlands with their requests as you progress on your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/52e1f97a2a54944835d32915fff213ba.poster.avif?t=1752093461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/52e1f97a2a54944835d32915fff213ba.webm?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/52e1f97a2a54944835d32915fff213ba.mp4?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paperlands</i> is a relaxing 2D puzzle adventure set in a papercraft world where everything can be interacted with only if brought to life with color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with no colors and gradually unlock new colors as you complete puzzles and help the people of Paperlands with their requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring things with different colors is the key and it can have interesting effects which will help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color the objects and people to be able to interact with them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/50f99af1df81ad4e51d71bec106b4256.poster.avif?t=1752093461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/50f99af1df81ad4e51d71bec106b4256.webm?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/50f99af1df81ad4e51d71bec106b4256.mp4?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and traditional puzzles by using the colors, unlock new colors and reach new locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/5ab354ca1ff8683733b92abcf13c9529.poster.avif?t=1752093461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/5ab354ca1ff8683733b92abcf13c9529.webm?t=1752093461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.